  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective the Engagement Facility is to support capacity development of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Montenegro. The Engagement Facility 2024-2027 will be implemented under the Direct Implementation Modality (DIM), through an agreed set of initiatives agreed by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Montenegro and UNDP and in line with the committed strategic priorities in the UNDP&#x2019;s Country Programme for 2023-2027</narrative>
